# Paper PDFs are tracked and published: the author holds the rights to them.
# Re-downloading from eLibrary mints a fresh filename for the same paper, so
# only the copy named in _data/papers.yml is committed; run papers_scan.py to
# find duplicates before adding anything here.
#
# These three are byte-identical re-downloads of papers already committed
# under another name. Publishing them would serve the same paper at two URLs.
pdf/elibrary_41467774_35862862.pdf
pdf/elibrary_41468023_60025918.pdf
pdf/elibrary_48079625_30236489.pdf
